/Title (Q10. How can Data Augmentation, Transfer Learning, and Hyperparameter Tuning improve deep learning image classification? Answer: Data augmentation creates variations of training images and can reduce overfitting. Transfer learning uses knowledge learned from an existing model and can reduce training requirements. Hyperparameter tuning helps select suitable learning rate, batch size, number of layers, epochs, and other training parameters.)
