<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 59 0 R
/T (Q1. What is image classification? How does it differ from object detection and image segmentation?)
/E (Q1. What is image classification? How does it differ from object detection and image segmentation?)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
286 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 59 0 R
/T (Answer: Image classification assigns one or more class labels to an image. Object detection identifies objects and also provides their locations using bounding boxes. Image segmentation assigns a class to individual pixels or regions of an image.)
/E (Answer: Image classification assigns one or more class labels to an image. Object detection identifies objects and also provides their locations using bounding boxes. Image segmentation assigns a class to individual pixels or regions of an image.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
